          "// Good: Dog IS-A Animal (true relationship)\nclass Dog extends Animal { }\n\n// Bad: Car IS-A Engine (not true - Car HAS-A Engine)\nclass Car extends Engine { }  // Wrong!\n\n// Correct approach for HAS-A:\nclass Car {\n    private Engine engine;\n}"
